h d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></nav></div><main class="site-main bg-[var(--site-body-bg)]"><article class="pb-24 font-sans text-foreground"><section class="w-full m-0"><div class="brand-hero-sheen relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-14 text-white md:px-8 md:py-20"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-20"><div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-white blur-3xl"></div></div><div class="container relative z-10"><div class=""><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col justify-center"><h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl leading-snug font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl md:leading-snug">Access to Market</h1><div class="min-w-0 mt-5 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/90 [&amp;_h1]:mb-3 [&amp;_h1]:text-3xl [&amp;_h1]:font-semibold [&amp;_h1]:leading-snug [&amp;_h1]:tracking-tight [&amp;_h1]:text-white md:[&amp;_h1]:text-4xl [&amp;_h2]:mb-2 [&amp;_h2]:text-xl [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:text-white [&amp;_h3]:mb-2 [&amp;_h3]:text-lg [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:text-white [&amp;_p]:mb-3 [&amp;_p:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:text-white/90"><p>Trade membership, transaction fees, connectivity to the NOREXECO Electronic Trading system and other trading technology partners.</p><p><br/></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="pt-10 md:pt-14"><div class="my-8 md:my-10 scroll-mt-28" data-block-type="featureGrid" id="page-overview"><section class="container"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--fintech-gray-50)] px-5 py-8 md:px-8 md:py-10"><div class="min-w-0 border-l-2 border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] pl-6 md:pl-7"><p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-inter)] text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--fintech-blue-600)]">Market access</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] md:text-[1.75rem] mt-3" style="line-height:1.25">Everything you need to trade on NOREXECO</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]">From membership and fees to ETS connectivity and the authorised member directory — all in one place.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="" delay="80"><a class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] p-4 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] hover:bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] group no-underline" href="#trade-membership"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--fintech-green-50)] text-[var(--fintech-green-800)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)]">Trade membership</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]">Trading rights, ECC onboarding, and the formal application process.</p></div></a></div><div class="" delay="140"><a class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] p-4 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] hover:bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] group no-underline" href="#services-fees"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--fintech-green-50)] text-[var(--fintech-green-800)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 21v-6"></path><path d="M12 21V3"></path><path d="M19 21V9"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)]">Services fees</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]">Transparent pricing for trading, clearing, data, and portal access.</p></div></a></div><div class="" delay="200"><a class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] p-4 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] hover:bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] group no-underline" href="#trade-members"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--fintech-green-50)] text-[var(--fintech-green-800)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"></path><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)]">Trade members</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]">Current list of firms authorised to trade on the exchange.</p></div></a></div><div class="" delay="260"><a class="flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] p-4 transition-colors hover:border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] hover:bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] group no-underline" href="#trading-venue"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--fintech-green-50)] text-[var(--fintech-green-800)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></span><div class="min-w-0"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)]">Trading Venue</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]">ETS portal, API/FIX connectivity, and ISV conformance onboarding.</p></div></a></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="my-10 md:my-12 mt-2 md:mt-3 mb-0 md:mb-0 scroll-mt-28" data-block-type="content" id="trade-membership"><div class="container"><div class="w-full"><section class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--fintech-gray-50)] p-6 md:p-8"><div class="min-w-0 border-l-2 border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] pl-6 md:pl-7"><p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-inter)] text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--fintech-blue-600)]">Trade Members</p><div class="w-full max-w-full min-w-0 font-sans antialiased text-foreground [&amp;_h1]:text-balance [&amp;_h1]:text-[clamp(1.875rem,4.2vw,2.375rem)] [&amp;_h1]:font-semibold [&amp;_h1]:tracking-tight [&amp;_h1]:leading-tight [&amp;_h1]:text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] dark:[&amp;_h1]:text-foreground [&amp;_h1]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:scroll-mt-28 [&amp;_h2]:border-border [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-2.5 [&amp;_h3]:border-border [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mt-6 [&amp;_h4]:mb-2 [&amp;_h4]:text-sm [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:text-foreground [&amp;_p]:text-[0.9375rem] [&amp;_p]:leading-[1.7] [&amp;_p]:mb-3.5 [&amp;_p]:text-muted-foreground [&amp;_p+p]:mt-0 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 hover:[&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:my-4 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:text-[0.9375rem] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:my-1.5 [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:text-muted-foreground [&amp;_ol]:my-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:text-[0.9375rem] [&amp;_ol&gt;li]:my-1.5 [&amp;_ol&gt;li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_ol&gt;li]:text-muted-foreground [&amp;_h2]:mt-8 [&amp;_h2]:first:mt-0 [&amp;_h2]:border-0 [&amp;_h2]:pb-0 [&amp;_h2]:text-lg sm:[&amp;_h2]:text-xl [&amp;_h2]:text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] dark:[&amp;_h2]:text-foreground [&amp;_h3]:mt-6 [&amp;_h3]:first:mt-0 [&amp;_h3]:border-0 [&amp;_h3]:pb-0 [&amp;_h3]:text-base sm:[&amp;_h3]:text-lg [&amp;_h3]:text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] dark:[&amp;_h3]:text-foreground [&amp;_p]:last:mb-0 [&amp;_h2:first-of-type]:mt-3 [&amp;_h2:first-of-type]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h2:first-of-type]:text-[1.75rem]"><h2>Trading as a Trade Member</h2><p>A Trade Member of NOREXECO is allowed to trade directly in the Electronic Trading System (ETS) or via the NOREXECO Market Service Desk. A Trade Member is also allowed to be a participant in Block Trades in NOREXECO Products.</p><p>A Trade Member may facilitate Direct Market Access (DMA) to its clients either directly in the ETS or by use of a third party order routing service.</p><h2>Membership requirements</h2><p>In order to become a Trade Member, the applicant must comply with the membership criteria of NOREXECO, have an agreement with a clearing bank at European Commodity Clearing AG (ECC), the clearing house partner of NOREXECO, and be approved as a Trading Participant by ECC.</p><h2>Application process</h2><p>NOREXECO and ECC have aligned the two application processes which have to be quite formal due to regulatory requirements. A membership application consists of some required information such as:</p><p>• Application forms to become a Trade Member of NOREXECO and Approved Trading Participant of ECC</p><p>• A commercial registry extract (no older than three months old)</p><p>• A duly signed and filled in ECC ‘know your customer’ (KYC) questionnaire</p><p>• Financial statements from the last fiscal year</p><p>• Organisational chart explaining the shareholder/ownership structure up to the Ultimate Parent as well as the direct and indirect beneficial owners</p><p>When both NOREXECO and ECC have approved the application, the procedure is concluded by signing a Trade Member agreement with NOREXECO and a three-party agreement between the applicant, ECC and the clearing bank.</p><p>Once you want to explore the benefits of being a trade member, or apply for membership, please contact NOREXECO and we will guide you through the process. If you want to learn more, take a look at our <a href="https://nxecms.blob.core.windows.net/web/rulebook/A08_2.1.1_NOREXECO-Rulebook-for-Trading-Appendix-08-Membership-Requirements-201500831.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">introduction document.</a></p></div></div></section></div></div></div><div class="my-6 md:my-8 scroll-mt-28" data-block-type="fintechTable" id="trade-members"><div class="container"><div class="w-full font-sans antialiased text-foreground"><section class="w-full"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] shadow-[var(--site-card-shadow)] shadow-[0_12px_32px_-20px_rgba(15,53,88,0.35)]"><div class="brand-hero-sheen border-t border-white/15"><button aria-controls="_R_3inpfabveivb_" aria-expanded="true" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 text-left md:py-4 px-5 md:px-6" type="button"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/15 text-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><p