h-blue-50)] px-4 py-4 md:mt-6 md:px-5" role="note"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--fintech-blue-700)] text-xs font-bold text-white">i</span><div class="space-y-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]"><p>* For settlement on recycled paper and pulp OTC contracts</p><p>Note: Mandatory reporting is required for all OTC settlement transactions. Fees are subject to standard VAT where applicable.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div><div class="my-10 md:my-12 mt-2 md:mt-3 mb-0 md:mb-0 scroll-mt-28" data-block-type="content" id="trading-venue"><div class="container"><div class="w-full"><section class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--fintech-gray-50)] p-6 md:p-8"><div class="min-w-0 border-l-2 border-[var(--fintech-green-600)] pl-6 md:pl-7"><p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-inter)] text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--fintech-blue-600)]">Trading Venue</p><div class="w-full max-w-full min-w-0 font-sans antialiased text-foreground [&amp;_h1]:text-balance [&amp;_h1]:text-[clamp(1.875rem,4.2vw,2.375rem)] [&amp;_h1]:font-semibold [&amp;_h1]:tracking-tight [&amp;_h1]:leading-tight [&amp;_h1]:text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] dark:[&amp;_h1]:text-foreground [&amp;_h1]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:scroll-mt-28 [&amp;_h2]:border-border [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h3]:mb-2.5 [&amp;_h3]:border-border [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mt-6 [&amp;_h4]:mb-2 [&amp;_h4]:text-sm [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:text-foreground [&amp;_p]:text-[0.9375rem] [&amp;_p]:leading-[1.7] [&amp;_p]:mb-3.5 [&amp;_p]:text-muted-foreground [&amp;_p+p]:mt-0 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:no-underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 hover:[&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_strong]:font-semibold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:my-4 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ul]:text-[0.9375rem] [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:my-1.5 [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:text-muted-foreground [&amp;_ol]:my-4 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:text-[0.9375rem] [&amp;_ol&gt;li]:my-1.5 [&amp;_ol&gt;li]:leading-relaxed [&amp;_ol&gt;li]:text-muted-foreground [&amp;_h2]:mt-8 [&amp;_h2]:first:mt-0 [&amp;_h2]:border-0 [&amp;_h2]:pb-0 [&amp;_h2]:text-lg sm:[&amp;_h2]:text-xl [&amp;_h2]:text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] dark:[&amp;_h2]:text-foreground [&amp;_h3]:mt-6 [&amp;_h3]:first:mt-0 [&amp;_h3]:border-0 [&amp;_h3]:pb-0 [&amp;_h3]:text-base sm:[&amp;_h3]:text-lg [&amp;_h3]:text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)] dark:[&amp;_h3]:text-foreground [&amp;_p]:last:mb-0 [&amp;_h2:first-of-type]:mt-3 [&amp;_h2:first-of-type]:text-2xl md:[&amp;_h2:first-of-type]:text-[1.75rem]"><h2>Trading venue</h2><p>The NOREXECO market place is supported by an Electronic Trading System, the KBT Portal, delivered by the European Energy Exchange AG owned company KB Technology Ltd. The Portal handles orders, automatching, passing on trades to European Commodity Clearing AG (ECC) for real time clearing and information distribution. Information is distributed globally via our web site, approved Independent Software Vendors (ISVs) and financial information distributors.</p><h2>Direct access to the Portal</h2><p>Trade Members access NOREXECO through the browser-based trading Portal. Access is controlled by username, password, TFA and IP whitelisting. Pre-trade limits apply and risk managers may impose clearing limits. Three named Portal users are included in the standard monthly fee. Additional users can be provisioned on request.</p><h2>FIX &amp; API connectivity</h2><p>Approved ISVs can connect via NOREXECO’s FIX or native API gateways. The ultimate FIX integration requires registration of a Portal user and gives Direct Market Access which covers order entry with MiFIR attributes, clearing information, pre-trade limits and market data while a less sophisticated API integration would support outgoing market data.</p><h2>Conformance &amp; onboarding</h2><p>New vendor connections must complete a conformance checklist and certification environment test before production access is granted. Contact the Desk for the onboarding pack and access credentials.</p><h2>Trading calendar &amp; notices</h2><p>Last trading days and final settlement dates for each contract are published in the <a href="/trading-calendar">trading calendar</a> and exchange notices.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div><div class="my-6 md:my-8 scroll-mt-28" data-block-type="finCta" id="member-list-cta"><section class="container"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-gradient-to-b from-[var(--site-surface-muted)] to-[var(--site-surface-card)] px-4 py-8 shadow-sm md:px-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-[var(--fintech-gray-200)] bg-[var(--site-surface-card)] p-8 text-center shadow-[var(--site-card-shadow)]"><div class="mx-auto mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--brand-btn-from)] to-[var(--brand-btn-to)] text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--fintech-blue-900)]">Ready to start the application?</h3><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--fintech-gray-700)]"><p>Our team will walk you through the NOREXECO and ECC onboarding processes, KYC documentation, and clearing setup.</p></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><a class="relative hover:cursor-pointer gap-2 whitespace-nowrap active:translate-y-0 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&