laining the shareholder/ownership structure up to the Ultimate Parent as well as the direct and indirect beneficial owners\"]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"children\":[\"When both NOREXECO and ECC have approved the application, the procedure is concluded by signing a Trade Member agreement with NOREXECO and a three-party agreement between the applicant, ECC and the clearing bank.\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"children\":[\"Once you want to explore the benefits of being a trade member, or apply for membership, please contact NOREXECO and we will guide you through the process. If you want to learn more, take a look at our \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"https://nxecms.blob.core.windows.net/web/rulebook/A08_2.1.1_NOREXECO-Rulebook-for-Trading-Appendix-08-Membership-Requirements-201500831.pdf\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"children\":[\"introduction document.\"]}]]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"children\":[\"Conformance \u0026 onboarding\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"children\":[\"New vendor connections must complete a conformance checklist and certification environment test before production access is granted. Contact the Desk for the onboarding pack and access credentials.\"]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"8\",{\"children\":[\"Trading calendar \u0026 notices\"]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"9\",{\"children\":[\"Last trading days and final settlement dates for each contract are published in the \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/trading-calendar\",\"rel\":\"$undefined\",\"target\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[\"trading calendar\"]}],\" and exchange notices.\"]}]\n"])</script></body></html>